多くの行動に対してはやや無力。電子オタク。\n\n最後に、このアプリを読んでくださってありがとうございます🥺💗💗！\n\nhttps://www.mihuashi.com/character-card/af4b2a37984b62f113279603183647278d72edfc?utm_source=direct&utm_campaign=character_card&utm_medium=share&utm_content=普通\n\nhttps://www.mihuashi.com/character-card/af4b2a37984b62f113279603183647278d72edfc?utm_source=direct&utm_campaign=character_card&utm_medium=share&utm_content=ordinary", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@NISHIO_Q/works/114", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/03e1908e/uploads/origins/27666056-9246-498b-8ccc-23bba3f72615?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d739dd541bd24e6e1636963d9d070950", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/03e1908e/uploads/origins/27666056-9246-498b-8ccc-23bba3f72615?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d739dd541bd24e6e1636963d9d070950, https://si.imgix.net/03e1908e/uploads/origins/27666056-9246-498b-8ccc-23bba3f72615?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0485754a9d92ce328022529f0af9ffbd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/03e1908e/uploads/origins/27666056-9246-498b-8ccc-23bba3f72615?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1adc89cd67a686c40290fbcac0997858 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、あなたの画風はとてもかわいいと思います！私のOCメイを描いていただけませんか？自由に好きなように描いてください。彼女はとても優しくて、お菓子が大好きです。このスケブに似てるかな？\n--->https://skeb.jp/@NISHIO_Q/works/84\n\n月OC参考\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1mL6onTv82MOLRk7eFGNpIPX2HQqumrat?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1mL6onTv82MOLRk7eFGNpIPX2HQqumrat?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@NISHIO_Q/works/113", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d7ed1fb0/uploads/origins/d11b3859-0cb9-45e7-8b5d-ddf2dc24b78e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed4a0eece8056392d56d412a4fefb036", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d7ed1fb0/uploads/origins/d11b3859-0